# RH1 — repository-local LF checkout policy.
#
# Bounded to the demonstrated Linux-sensitive reporter surface: these
# files carry LF bytes in the Git index and must materialize as LF in
# every worktree regardless of ambient global/user core.autocrlf.
# Deliberately NOT a repository-wide `* text eol=lf` rule.
*.sh text eol=lf
packaging/systemd/** text eol=lf
tests/fixtures/reporter/** text eol=lf
